# The decoded form is a CACHE — one ffmpeg call per clip, rebuilt by FETCH.py
# from the committed `mp3/` sources beside it. ⛔ Never commit wav/ (36 MB for
# 3 MB of actual information); ⛔ never gitignore mp3/ — those ARE the
# deterministic input to thirteen rendered tracks, and a source site that
# changes a clip must not be able to change our music behind our backs.
wav/
